<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/a2fb9b1e-80a1-4476-8298-3de26092519c.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/Sa2fb9b1e-80a1-4476-8298-3de26092519c.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/15a3e5bc-c95a-40b0-ba88-6666ea1f8422.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/S15a3e5bc-c95a-40b0-ba88-6666ea1f8422.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/07189e3f-5e40-4345-b96e-1a4a56637b27.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/S07189e3f-5e40-4345-b96e-1a4a56637b27.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
