<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/9060becb-f18d-4d1f-acc7-741a2f732af2.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/S9060becb-f18d-4d1f-acc7-741a2f732af2.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/a93c981e-d76f-49a8-b928-79e292ad6eec.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/Sa93c981e-d76f-49a8-b928-79e292ad6eec.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/e13a6ad8-e3db-4c19-b075-3d1b77dc9208.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/Se13a6ad8-e3db-4c19-b075-3d1b77dc9208.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: center"><a href="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/473437a2-77dc-4dd5-8f2d-3313173489cc.jpg" target="_blank"><img alt="16+2+2相供电 配4路M.2！技嘉B850 AORUS ELITE X3D图赏" h="400" src="//img1.mydrivers.com/img/20260920/S473437a2-77dc-4dd5-8f2d-3313173489cc.jpg" style="border:black 1px solid" w="600" /></a></p>
